plete and readable.</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">Read the article &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></em></li><li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"journal/img/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"journal/img/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"en hx-ei\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">30 Oct 2026 · AI news</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</b>Deep dive: OpenAI&#x27;s GPT-6.1 Terra Fast, cheap, good at reading images and using a computer.</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">Read the article &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></em></li>", "caps": "<div class=\"hx-c c-lab\" data-i=\"3\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-lab\"><span class=\"en\">Lab</span></span><b>T12</b><span class=\"en hx-of\">4 of 7</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"lab/hk-swept-path/\"><span class=\"en\">HK Swept Path</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"en\">Car park swept path check · Hong Kong</span></p><p class=\"en hx-sum\">Drop in a car park plan (PDF, image or DXF), mark the entrance, exit and bays, and your browser drives vehicles from the TPDM, from a private car to a container truck, into and out of every bay. Each bay is graded green, amber or red against our reading of APP-111&#x27;s one-manoeuvre guideline, with clashes painted where they happen; export layered DXF, PNG and PDF.</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"lab/hk-swept-path/\"><span class=\"en\">Open the tool</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></span><span class=\"en hx-of\">5 of 7</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/missing-north-arrow-scale-bar-left/\"><span class=\"en\">A missing north arrow. A scale bar left off a drawing</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"en\">30 October 2026 · AI × architecture</span></p><p class=\"en hx-sum has-q\">A missing north arrow. A scale bar left off a drawing. A site plan uploaded as the wrong document type. Small slips, and each can hold up a planning application before anyone looks at the design.</p><p class=\"en hx-q\">What I find useful is what the tool checks: not design merit, but whether the package is complete and readable.</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/missing-north-arrow-scale-bar-left/\"><span class=\"en\">Read the article</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></span><span class=\"en hx-of\">6 of 7</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\"><span class=\"en\">Three AI stories this week, plus a deep dive that matters to anyone who works with…</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"en\">30 October 2026 · AI news</span></p><p class=\"en hx-sum has-q\">I made a 7-minute video for YouTube 👇 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_UenZgdDEGY This week: ・26 Oct: Anthropic, the maker of Claude, filed its S-1 for a Nasdaq listing under the ticker ANT.</p><p class=\"en hx-q\">Deep dive: OpenAI&#x27;s GPT-6.1 Terra Fast, cheap, good at reading images and using a computer.</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\"><span class=\"en\">Read the article</span> &rarr;</a></p></div>", "rows": "<li class=\"k-lab\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"lab/hk-swept-path/\" data-go=