t/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/missing-north-arrow-scale-bar-left/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">2026 年 10 月 30 日 · AI × 建築</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</b>換言之,AI 已在提交時檢查規劃申請,不久議會一方亦會使用。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">閱讀全文 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></em></li><li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">2026 年 10 月 30 日 · AI 新聞</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</b>最得我注意嘅係：OpenAI 用嚟測試佢嘅題目入面，有一題係將建築圖則變做 3D 模型。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">閱讀全文 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></em></li>", "caps": "<div class=\"hx-c c-lab\" data-i=\"3\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-lab\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></span><b>T12</b><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 4 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"lab/hk-swept-path/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">泊車軌跡</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">停車場掃掠軌跡檢查 · 香港</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">放入停車場平面圖（PDF、圖片或 DXF），標示入口、出口及車位，瀏覽器便會駕駛運輸署《運輸策劃及設計手冊》所列車輛（由私家車到貨櫃車）駛入及駛出每一個車位，按我們對 APP-111「一次清晰的操控動作」指引的理解評為綠、黃或紅，並標示碰撞位置；可匯出分層 DXF、PNG 及 PDF。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"lab/hk-swept-path/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">開啟工具</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 5 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/missing-north-arrow-scale-bar-left/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">缺少指北針、圖則漏了比例尺、地盤平面圖被標成錯誤的文件類別</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 30 日 · AI × 建築</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">這些都是小錯誤,卻足以在任何人審閱設計之前,令規劃申請停滯。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">換言之,AI 已在提交時檢查規劃申請,不久議會一方亦會使用。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/missing-north-arrow-scale-bar-left/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 6 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">今個星期 AI 有三單新聞，加一個同做建築嘅人好有關嘅深入分析</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 30 日 · AI 新聞</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">我整咗一條 7 分鐘片，放咗上 YouTube 👇 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_UenZgdDEGY 本周三單： ・10 月 26 號，整 Claude 嘅 Anthropic 向美國證監會交咗上市申請（S-1），計劃喺 Nasdaq 上市，代號 ANT。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">最得我注意嘅係：OpenAI 用嚟測試佢嘅題目入面，有一題係將建築圖則變做 3D 模型。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/three-ai-stories-week-plus-deep/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div>", "rows": "<li class=\"k-lab\" data-new=